    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">60 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Machine-coding case study</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Rank 2 of 45</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Movie Ticket Booking (BookMyShow)</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Thousands of people tap the same seat at the same second. This page builds a booking system where a seat is held for a few minutes while you pay, released automatically if you do not, and never sold twice, with both a pessimistic (lock) and an optimistic (compare-and-set) implementation you can run and compare.</p>\n"
